---
import WorksheetLayout from '../../../../layouts/WorksheetLayout.astro';
---
<WorksheetLayout
  title="Artist Statement"
  lesson="/courses/mfedu-2026/gallery-and-artist-statements/"
  intro="This card stands next to your piece at the exhibition — it speaks when you're not there."
>
  <h2>The basics</h2>
  <p><strong>Piece title:</strong></p>
  <div class="ws-lines"><div></div></div>
  <p><strong>Design team (names &amp; ages):</strong></p>
  <div class="ws-lines"><div></div></div>
  <p><strong>Model:</strong></p>
  <div class="ws-lines"><div></div></div>

  <h2>The story</h2>
  <p>What is this piece advocating for, and why does it matter to you? (3–5 sentences — this is the heart of the card.)</p>
  <div class="ws-lines"><div></div><div></div><div></div><div></div><div></div></div>

  <h2>Materials &amp; technology</h2>
  <p>What is it made of, and what makes it light up?</p>
  <div class="ws-lines"><div></div><div></div></div>

  <h2>The hard part</h2>
  <p>What went wrong along the way, and how did you get past it?</p>
  <div class="ws-lines"><div></div><div></div></div>

  <h2>Practice round</h2>
  <ul class="ws-checks">
    <li>I can say the story out loud in under a minute without reading</li>
    <li>I have an answer ready for "how does it work?"</li>
    <li>I have an answer ready for "what would you do differently?"</li>
  </ul>
</WorksheetLayout>
